      "Version-based migrations in onUpgrade",
      "Repositories handle all SQL queries",
      "Never expose raw database outside repositories"
    ],
    "providers": [
      "One provider file per domain",
      "Use AsyncNotifier for data that loads from DB",
      "Computed providers for derived data (analytics)",
      "Keep providers focused - split if they get complex"
    ],
    "ui": [
      "Screens are full pages, receive IDs as params",
      "Widgets are reusable components, receive data as params",
