      "Forms use Flutter's built-in Form/TextFormField",
      "Show loading states with AsyncValue.when()"
    ],
    "error_handling": [
      "Repositories return data or throw exceptions",
      "Providers catch exceptions and expose via AsyncValue",
      "UI shows user-friendly error messages",
      "Log errors but don't crash"
